---
import Tilde from '../../layouts/Tilde.astro';
---

<Tilde user="sadia" title="Sadia's corner" icon="✿" description="my first website">
  <main>
    <h1>hi, I'm Sadia 👋</h1>
    <p>
      CSE 3rd year, Dhaka. This is my first website ever. I wrote it in nano over SSH the day my
      account came through, and I've been adding to it since.
    </p>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>things I learned this month</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><code>display: grid</code> is not scary. <code>grid-template-areas</code> is a little scary.</li>
        <li><code>chmod 644</code> fixes the 403 every single time.</li>
        <li>git rebase made my heart stop. Then ~nafis showed me <code>git reflog</code>.</li>
        <li>You can write CSS without a framework and the page still loads.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>what I'm doing now</h2>
      <p>Helping ~prottoy teach Shell Saturday #3 on 17 October. I'm doing the grep part. Please come, I need an audience that isn't my cat.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>my first ever version</h2>
      <p>Kept as is, because I'm proud of it:</p>
      <pre>&lt;h1&gt;hello from ~sadia&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;i just joined mukto.net&lt;/p&gt;</pre>
      <p class="small">It's in <a href="/members/#projects">sadia/first-site</a>. PRs that make it worse are welcome.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Tilde>

<style is:global>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #e0f2f1, #ede7f6);
    color: #263238;
    font: 17px/1.6 'Trebuchet MS', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  main {
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.25rem 1rem;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: #4527a0;
  }
  .card {
    background: #ffffffcc;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #b39ddb;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    color: #00796b;
  }
  ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  code,
  pre {
    font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
    background: #ede7f6;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }
  code {
    padding: 0 0.3rem;
  }
  pre {
    padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  a {
    color: #4527a0;
  }
  .small {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
